(The essential idea of "legal tender" is that quality given to money by) Tj T*
(law which obliges the creditor to receive it in full satisfaction of a) Tj T*
(past debt when expressed in general terms of the money of a country. A) Tj T*
(debt is a sum of money due by contract, express or implied. When our) Tj T*
(laws, for instance, declare that United States notes are legal) Tj T*
