(received. On the other hand, if this estate had been left to a youth of) Tj T*
(twenty who intended to invest his property in some business after a few) Tj T*
(years, the rate of interest would be of relatively less importance to) Tj T*
(him than the purchasing power of the principal when the time came to set) Tj T*
(up for himself.) Tj T*
