() Tj T*
(     that this house cordially concurs in the view of the) Tj T*
(     Secretary of the Treasury in relation to the necessity of a) Tj T*
(     contraction of the currency, with a view to as early a) Tj T*
(     resumption of specie payments as the business interests of) Tj T*
