() Tj T*
([26]The monthly issues of the new Treasury notes vary, like those of the) Tj T*
(old silver certificates, with the price of silver. But the new issues) Tj T*
(vary directly with the price of silver, while as we have seen, the old) Tj T*
(issues varied inversely with the price. The volume of Treasury notes) Tj T*
(issued is equal to the market price of four and one-half million ounces) Tj T*
(of silver. For a month or two after the passage of the act, the price of) Tj T*
(silver advanced rapidly, and at its highest, on August 19, 1890,) Tj T*
