(result....) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(I propose here to take up chiefly one set of serious arguments--those) Tj T*
(which rest on the changes in general prices which have taken place) Tj T*
(throughout the civilised world in the last twenty years. The conclusions) Tj T*
(in favor of a wider use of silver, drawn from such changes, have been) Tj T*
(maintained by distinguished economists. It is true that the particular) Tj T*
(plans for the use of silver which are now in vogue in the United States) Tj T*
(have generally been opposed by these economists. They have urged) Tj T*
