(The construction of an index number presents the following problems:) Tj T*
(\(_a_\) What are the commodities of which the prices are to be taken?) Tj T*
(\(_b_\) How are the prices to be ascertained? \(_c_\) How are the ratios) Tj T*
(between the prices of each article at the current and the standard dates) Tj T*
(to be combined?) Tj T*
