(combination of the ratios is an average of the kind technically called) Tj T*
(_weighted_.... The general principle according to which the weights are) Tj T*
(to be assigned is that they should represent the importance of each) Tj T*
(commodity to the consumer. But this idea may be embodied in different) Tj T*
(plans.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
