(between prices, the value of the corresponding commodity at the initial) Tj T*
(or standard period. According to this plan the index number is the ratio) Tj T*
(between these two values: the quantities initially consumed at the) Tj T*
(prices of the current date, and the same quantities at the standard) Tj T*
(prices. This method is exemplified by Sir R. Giffen's estimate of the) Tj T*
