(articles specified by the Committee may thus be expressed. The) Tj T*
(discrepancy which is as likely as not to occur between the committee's) Tj T*
(and other results is from 2 to 2.5 per cent. The discrepancy which is) Tj T*
(very unlikely to occur is from 8 to 11 per cent. \(_Report of the British) Tj T*
(Association_ for 1888, p. 217\). In fact, the index number for the year) Tj T*
