([31]The intermediate employed in actual transactions is, in increasing) Tj T*
(degree, that form of currency called credit, the lowest order of) Tj T*
(currency, rather than money itself. Checks and drafts make up a) Tj T*
(progressively larger share of the circulating medium. The net deposit) Tj T*
(credits in the national banks in the United States--to say nothing of) Tj T*
(the other banks--are double the volume of the actual money in the) Tj T*
(country. And a large share of this actual money is really employed as) Tj T*
(reserves to support the credit circulation. More than 90 per cent. of) Tj T*
(the larger sorts of transactions are mediated through the use of deposit) Tj T*
(credit, and probably more than one-half of the remaining transactions) Tj T*
(are similarly effected. Thus the study of banking is essential to any) Tj T*
(understanding of monetary problems....) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([32]For a bank, as well as for any other considerable establishment, it) Tj T*
(is requisite that a capital should be provided at the outset. There can) Tj T*
(be no constant proportion between the amount of this capital and the) Tj T*
(extent of the business which may be built up by its means. We can only) Tj T*
(say that, other things being equal, the larger the business that can be) Tj T*
(carried on with safety with a given capital, the larger will be the) Tj T*
(field from which profits can be earned, and the higher the proportion) Tj T*
(which the profits will bear to the original investment; but the point at) Tj T*
(which the extension of the business passes the line of safety, must be) Tj T*
(determined by the circumstances of the particular bank, by the kind of) Tj T*
(business carried on by those dealing with it, and by the condition of) Tj T*
(the community in which it is established. The attempt has sometimes) Tj T*
(been made to limit by law for incorporated banks the proportion of) Tj T*
(transactions for a given amount of capital, but no such provision has) Tj T*
(any foundation except a conjectured average, too rough to be of service) Tj T*
(in any individual case. In this respect, as in so many others, the) Tj T*
(judgment of the persons most interested, acting under the law of) Tj T*
(self-preservation, is far more trustworthy than any legislative) Tj T*
(decision.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The capital thus to be provided at the outset is, of course, in the case) Tj T*
(of a private bank, the contribution of the partners, as in any other) Tj T*
(undertaking. In the case of an incorporated bank the capital is divided) Tj T*
(by law into equal shares or units of fixed amount; as _e. g._, under the) Tj T*
(law of the United States, a capital of $100,000 is divided into 1,000) Tj T*
(shares of $100 each; and these shares are contributed by the individual) Tj T*
(shareholders, in such proportion as they please. The law may as a matter) Tj T*
(of public policy limit the proportion of capital stock to be owned by) Tj T*
(any one individual or firm, and it may also limit the liability of) Tj T*
(shareholders for debts due by the bank, in case of its failure; but in) Tj T*
(general, in the absence of special provisions to the contrary, the) Tj T*
