(same companies. In such cases, separate departments are maintained for) Tj T*
(the various classes of business. Another method is for the same) Tj T*
(individuals to organize a national bank and a trust company, the former) Tj T*
(under national and the latter under state laws.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
