(controlled by a national bank with the stock interest in the former) Tj T*
(distributed among the owners of the stock of the bank and evidenced by) Tj T*
(indorsement on its certificates is still another expedient which has) Tj T*
(been resorted to in order to enable a closely affiliated and controlled) Tj T*
(organization to exercise legitimate functions which are, however,) Tj T*
(outside the province of a national bank.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The earning power of trust companies has equalled and even exceeded that) Tj T*
(of the banks, and the stock of those companies which are well) Tj T*
(established and doing a flourishing business sells at such a premium) Tj T*
