() Tj T*
(Trust company failures have been few and far between, and where they) Tj T*
(have occurred they can be traced to a disregard of sound banking) Tj T*
(principles and to the assumption of unwarranted risks. Even in the case) Tj T*
(of companies which have failed there is no record of any impairment of) Tj T*
(trust funds, whatever loss there was having been borne by the) Tj T*
(stockholders and, to a less degree, by the depositors. This fact, the) Tj T*
(result of the absolute separation of trust assets from assets belonging) Tj T*
(to the company, is the strongest argument for the employment of trust) Tj T*
(companies in fiduciary capacities, and explains their rapid growth in) Tj T*
(popular favor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The literature put out by these institutions invariably recites the) Tj T*
(advantages to be gained by dealing with them instead of with) Tj T*
(individuals. The following is a good example of such reasoning:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(THE ADVANTAGES OF A TRUST COMPANY AS TRUSTEE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A trust company is preferable to individual trustees, because it) Tj T*
(possesses every quality of desirability which the individual lacks, to) Tj T*
(wit:--) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     \(1\) Its permanency: it does not die.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     \(2\) It does not go abroad.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     \(3\) It does not become insane.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     \(4\) It does not imperil the trust by failure or dishonesty.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     \(5\) Its experience and judgment in trust matters are beyond) Tj T*
(     dispute.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     \(6\) It never neglects its work or hands it over to) Tj T*
(     untrustworthy people.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     \(7\) It does not refuse to act from caprice or on the ground) Tj T*
(     of inexperience.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     \(8\) It is invariably on hand during business hours and can) Tj T*
(     be consulted at all times.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     \(9\) Its wide experience of trust business and trust) Tj T*
(     securities is invaluable to the estate.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     \(10\) It is absolutely confidential.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     \(11\) It has no sympathies or antipathies and no politics.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     \(12\) It can be relied upon to act up to its instructions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
