(amount. The lowest deposit permitted is one dollar, the limit being $100) Tj T*
(in a calendar month; but to provide for small deposits, a postal savings) Tj T*
(card is issued for ten cents, to which may be attached postal savings) Tj T*
(stamps, which when filled will be accepted in lieu of one dollar.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The interest rate allowed is 2 per cent., credited once a year, and the) Tj T*
