(country, so far as I know, and reference to it is particularly timely as) Tj T*
(Christmas is approaching. A mining company in that city struck the note) Tj T*
(and I hope it will be heard from one end of this country to the other.) Tj T*
(It was this: Last December an officer of the company went to the post) Tj T*
(office and opened a postal savings account for every employee--ninety in) Tj T*
(all--as a Christmas present. He placed to the credit of each 2 per cent.) Tj T*
(of what he had earned during the year. These Christmas remembrances) Tj T*
(amounted to over fifteen hundred dollars. Out of the ninety employees) Tj T*
(only five had previously opened postal savings accounts. Now, I count) Tj T*
(that substantial charity; I call that well-directed charity. We have) Tj T*
(kept track of these particular deposits and the workmen who get their) Tj T*
(start through that Christmas bounty are adding to their savings weekly) Tj T*
(by their own personal efforts. \(Applause.\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
