(measured arc, and the little one can do is so small when compared with) Tj T*
(the mass of Government activity that we feel insignificant and lost. But) Tj T*
(I feel, my friends, that in the Postal Savings System my associates and) Tj T*
(I are doing a positive good for humanity. I believe that we are making) Tj T*
(people better and happier because postal savings points the way from the) Tj T*
