(that both the words "unfavourable balance of trade" and "unfavourable) Tj T*
(exchanges" involve fallacy. But merchants and bankers are influenced by) Tj T*
(the feeling, that at any given moment they may be under greater) Tj T*
(liabilities for imports than they can temporarily meet, owing to the) Tj T*
(system of credit which disturbs the coincidence of payments for exports) Tj T*
