(Act grants to national banks the privilege of accepting drafts or bills) Tj T*
(of exchange growing out of transactions involving the importation or) Tj T*
(exportation of goods. This acceptance privilege was accorded to national) Tj T*
(banks only a short time before the commencement of hostilities abroad,) Tj T*
