() Tj T*
(As a factor in creating the existing demand for Dollar Credits, the) Tj T*
(establishment of American branch banks abroad cannot be emphasized too) Tj T*
(strongly. Through these branch banks, a new and adequate medium for the) Tj T*
(liquidation of transactions as between the United States and certain) Tj T*
(South American countries, especially the Argentine, Brazil, and Uruguay,) Tj T*
