() Tj T*
(If there is a stock operation in the conduct of a foreign exchange) Tj T*
(business it is the selling by bankers of their demand bills of exchange) Tj T*
(against remittances of commercial and bankers' long paper. Bills of the) Tj T*
(latter class make up the bulk of foreign exchange traded in, and its) Tj T*
(disposal naturally is the most important phase of foreign exchange) Tj T*
(business. What the foreign exchange business really is grounded on is) Tj T*
(the existence of commercial bills called into existence by exports of) Tj T*
(merchandise.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Buying and remitting commercial long bills is no pastime for an) Tj T*
(inexperienced man. Entirely aside from the question of rate, and profit) Tj T*
(on the exchange end of the transaction, there must be taken into) Tj T*
(consideration the matter of the credit of the drawer and the drawee, the) Tj T*
(salability of the merchandise specified in the bill of lading, and a) Tj T*
(number of other important points.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Where documents accompany the draft and the merchandise is formally) Tj T*
(hypothecated to the buyer of the draft, it might not be thought that the) Tj T*
(standing of the drawer would be of such great importance. Possession of) Tj T*
(the merchandise, it is true, gives the banker a certain form of security) Tj T*
(in case acceptance of the bill is refused by the parties on whom it is) Tj T*
(drawn or in case they refuse to pay it when it comes due, but the) Tj T*
(disposal of such collateral is a burdensome and often expensive) Tj T*
(operation. The banker in New York who buys a sixty-day draft drawn) Tj T*
(against a shipment of butter is presumably not an expert on the butter) Tj T*
(market and if he should be forced to sell the butter, might not be able) Tj T*
(to do so to the fullest possible advantage. Employment of an expert) Tj T*
(agent is an expensive operation, and, moreover, there is always the) Tj T*
(danger of legal complication arising out of the banker's having sold the) Tj T*
(collateral. It is desirable in every way that if there is to be any) Tj T*
(trouble about the acceptance or payment of a draft, the banker should) Tj T*
(keep himself out of it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
