(standard ounce, and on this basis A. Blank & Company have calculated the) Tj T*
(selling price which is to yield them L1,000. By the time the calico) Tj T*
(arrives in Shanghai, the gold price of silver has dropped, we will) Tj T*
(suppose, to 20_d._ per standard ounce, and this obviously indicates that) Tj T*
(the manufacturers will receive one-fifth less for their wares, since) Tj T*
(they are paid in the currency of the province \(taels in this instance\),) Tj T*
(and when Blank & Company's money comes to be converted back into British) Tj T*
(gold pieces, they are face to face with the fact that the outturn is) Tj T*
(L200 less than they had calculated: they have lost one-fifth, and) Tj T*
(receive L800 only. This is, of course, an extreme case, as in the) Tj T*
(ordinary course silver would be unlikely to drop 5_d._ in the period) Tj T*
(between shipment and arrival of the goods in Shanghai; but whatever the) Tj T*
(fall, the principle is the same, and the illustration serves to show) Tj T*
(exactly what happens.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is not only the British exporters who stand to lose in the lottery of) Tj T*
(trade with countries which have an unstable silver exchange; the) Tj T*
(capitalist also, and every class of investor, is liable to be adversely) Tj T*
(affected in operations with silver standard countries. The rate of) Tj T*
(exchange between such countries and gold standard countries is plainly) Tj T*
(the exchange between gold and silver; therefore, if a person has) Tj T*
(invested in undertakings in the silver country, when he receives his) Tj T*
(dividends in the currency of that country, he will obtain less for his) Tj T*
(dividend warrant on the London market in proportion to the fall in the) Tj T*
(price of silver--assuming that it does fall. Conversely, he may reap a) Tj T*
(higher return on his investment if silver has gone up before the) Tj T*
(encashment of his dividend.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Finally, the principal is affected in the same way, whenever it is) Tj T*
(desired to convert it back into gold. A further example will show how) Tj T*
(this works out in practice.) Tj T*
