(certificates," with which latter only are we here concerned.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Clearing-house loan certificates may be defined as temporary loans made) Tj T*
(by the banks associated together as a clearing-house association, to the) Tj T*
(members thereof, for the purpose of settling clearing-house balances.) Tj T*
(Such certificates are negotiable, as a rule, only among the members of) Tj T*
