() Tj T*
(To obtain an intelligent understanding of the real character and purpose) Tj T*
(of such certificates it will be well to treat somewhat of the) Tj T*
(circumstances under which they are issued. In the course of the present) Tj T*
(century the United States has undergone periodical derangements of) Tj T*
(business affairs, when confidence was displaced by mistrust, when the) Tj T*
(payment of debts became difficult, when property values declined, and) Tj T*
(business houses failed; when industry and trade were paralyzed, and) Tj T*
(general stagnation ensued in all lines of enterprise. In such times) Tj T*
(depositors in banks, stricken with fear and sometimes pressed by need,) Tj T*
(draw out their deposits, in many cases to such an extent as to render it) Tj T*
(difficult or even impossible for the banks to contract their loans) Tj T*
(sufficiently to meet the demands thus made upon them. Under our currency) Tj T*
(system no adequate method is [was] provided for expanding the money) Tj T*
(volume as occasion demands, whereby the banks can continue their usual) Tj T*
(loans and discounts, and thus prevent a panic with all its evil) Tj T*
(consequences. Hence it is left in a large measure to the financiers of) Tj T*
(each community to work out their own remedy, supplemented by such mutual) Tj T*
(assistance as a courteous regard for each other may dictate or as) Tj T*
(business relations may demand.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Quick to see the defects in our currency system, and the desirability of) Tj T*
(in some way supplying it, the bankers of New York, nearly fifty years) Tj T*
(ago, devised the scheme of issuing clearing-house loan certificates as a) Tj T*
(method of relief from temporary stringencies. Subsequently, nearly all) Tj T*
(the clearing houses in the great centres adopted the same device, and by) Tj T*
(their heroic resort to the measure they have at different times relieved) Tj T*
(the business community of untold disaster, for which invaluable service) Tj T*
(they have justly received the grateful recognition of the entire) Tj T*
(country.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The great value of clearing-house loan certificates lies in the fact) Tj T*
(that they take the place of money in settlements at the clearing house,) Tj T*
(and hence save the use of so much actual cash, leaving the amount to be) Tj T*
(used by the banks in making loans and discounts, and in meeting other) Tj T*
