(every case. by note-issuing banks. This seems at once to indicate that) Tj T*
(in places where notes are the most important medium of exchange a) Tj T*
(connection of some sort exists between the issue of notes and the) Tj T*
(establishment of branches.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
