(securities represent partly an investment carried as a secondary reserve) Tj T*
(and partly a business carried on for the benefit of their customers. In) Tj T*
(Canada the demand for long-time investments is not large, but whatever) Tj T*
(market there is for securities is mainly in the hands of the chartered) Tj T*
(banks. An investor seeks the advice of a bank manager and often is able) Tj T*
