(payment in daily transactions. In Scotland, banking evaded the spirit) Tj T*
(of Peel's regulations, which were intended to insure that every addition) Tj T*
(to currency should be secured on an addition to the bullion held by it,) Tj T*
(by actually economising bullion to the extent of L8,000,000 or) Tj T*
(L10,000,000.) Tj T*
