(one upon which it is possible to lay too much stress. In assessing the) Tj T*
(strength of a bank it is usual to compare the amount of its cash in) Tj T*
(hand, as a whole, with the amount of its liability to the public on) Tj T*
(deposit and current account, etc., and note circulation if any. The cash) Tj T*
