(narrow.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Though the functions that they perform are practically the same as those) Tj T*
(of the English bankers, Scotchmen have succeeded in avoiding the) Tj T*
(excessive competition in carrying them out which is a weakness of) Tj T*
(English banking. In Scotland, on the other hand, cohesion and) Tj T*
(co-operation among the banks are carried to an extreme of which the) Tj T*
(mercantile community frequently complains. The banks are few and stand) Tj T*
(together like a close corporation; they agree absolutely and arbitrarily) Tj T*
