(may draw cheques on the bank until the balance due to us reaches a) Tj T*
(certain fixed limit. The account is an ordinary operative one, and) Tj T*
(interest is charged on the balances actually due to the bank from day to) Tj T*
(day.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Have you in mind how many branches you had ten years ago?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
