(Scotland \(Limited\), the National Bank of Scotland \(Limited\), the North) Tj T*
(of Scotland and Town and County Bank \(Limited\), the Union Bank of) Tj T*
(Scotland \(Limited\), the Clydesdale Bank \(Limited\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Are the notes of your issuing banks secured; and if so, how?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. They are not secured. In case of the liquidation of the five) Tj T*
(last-named banks, however, their shareholders are unlimitedly liable for) Tj T*
