(your main office in Edinburgh?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Yes; very much the same. The head office has administrative work and) Tj T*
(supervision of branches, investment, etc., which does not, of course,) Tj T*
(arise elsewhere.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Do you discount to any considerable amount for individuals and) Tj T*
(merchants?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Yes; it would perhaps be well to point out that in Scotland a large) Tj T*
(portion of advances made to traders are granted in the form of) Tj T*
(overdrafts on current accounts. _The number and amount of bills in) Tj T*
(Scotland are less now than in former years. Cash payments for the) Tj T*
(purpose of obtaining discount are more frequent, and the number of) Tj T*
(bills discounted by wholesale houses is reduced in consequence._) Tj T*
() Tj T*
