() Tj T*
(A. It is not our practice to do so.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. To what extent does bank rate govern your discount and loan) Tj T*
(transactions?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. In ordinary transactions, altogether. In all transactions the bank) Tj T*
(rate governs as regards the minimum.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
