() Tj T*
(A. No; on the contrary, the Government began by giving us a subsidy of) Tj T*
(10,000,000 francs; that was at the beginning, in 1852, in order to help) Tj T*
(us make loans at a rate advantageous for that time. This subsidy was not) Tj T*
