() Tj T*
(Q. What is the minimum size of your mortgages on private estates?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. There is no minimum; but we do not care to make very small loans) Tj T*
(because it costs too much to foreclose.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. What percentage of your total business is in the country and what in) Tj T*
(the city?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. About one-half in Paris, and our best business is in Paris. The urban) Tj T*
(mortgages cause us less difficulty, and the tendency is for the) Tj T*
(proportion of them to increase.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Who are the subscribers to the bonds, and what are the usual sums) Tj T*
(subscribed? Are they small or large?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. They are bought by small people, and generally remain in the hands of) Tj T*
(persons of small capital. This is one of the reasons why their) Tj T*
(quotations show so little fluctuation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Do you lend on farms?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Yes. Up to one-half, except on forest land, vineyards, and the like,) Tj T*
(on which we lend only one-third. We do not lend on mines. On factory) Tj T*
(buildings we lend only on the value of the ground and of the building,) Tj T*
(independently of its industrial value.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. What other institutions of this character are there in France?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. There are no others; we no longer have a _legal_ monopoly, but we) Tj T*
(very nearly have a _practical_ monopoly. There are private individuals) Tj T*
(who make mortgage loans, but no large company makes this the principal) Tj T*
(feature of its business.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. How long has it been the privilege of the Credit Foncier to add) Tj T*
(lotteries to its loans?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. It has done so from the beginning, although we are obliged to ask the) Tj T*
(permission of the Minister, but it is on that account that we have been) Tj T*
(able to place our bonds so low.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CAISSE DES DEPOTS ET CONSIGNATIONS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(INTERVIEW WITH M. DELATOUR, GENERAL DIRECTOR OF THE CAISSE DES DEPOTS ET) Tj T*
(CONSIGNATIONS[182]) Tj T*
