(watch him, and if four or five days afterwards he has no cow, they know) Tj T*
(it. As the liability is without limit, the other members of the locality) Tj T*
(would be responsible. At the beginning the farmers were afraid of) Tj T*
(unlimited liability, and on that account they had to make it limited,) Tj T*
(but now, in all of the new offices, the responsibility is unlimited.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. What are your co-operative societies?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. They are societies for the production, preservation, sale, or) Tj T*
(transformation of agricultural products. There are co-operative) Tj T*
(agricultural societies in the wine-growing regions which have their own) Tj T*
(wine cellar; there are co-operative dairy societies for making butter) Tj T*
(and cheese; there are also co-operative societies which use waterfalls) Tj T*
(and electricity; co-operative mills to grind corn; co-operative railways) Tj T*
(to bring beet roots to the sugar refinery; co-operative distilleries and) Tj T*
(co-operative warehouses for corn. To these co-operative societies we) Tj T*
(make loans for twenty-five years. The Government loans without charge to) Tj T*
(the regional office and the regional office lends to these co-operative) Tj T*
(societies for twenty-five years at 2 per cent.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. What is the security?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. The guarantee is the consolidated liability of all of the members of) Tj T*
(these co-operative societies and also a mortgage upon their real estate;) Tj T*
(their responsibility is absolutely without limit.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Do you compete at all with the branches of the other banks or with) Tj T*
(the Bank of France?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. No; we have an entirely different class of customers.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Is there any other institution of this character in France, or do you) Tj T*
(practically cover the field?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. The members of these local offices are people who up to the time) Tj T*
(these local offices were organised had never had any banking connection) Tj T*
(at all. The only persons with whom the local offices compete are) Tj T*
(individuals who used to loan to farmers at very high rates of interest.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
