() Tj T*
(The partisans of the town banks are apt to pride themselves on their) Tj T*
(complete self-sufficiency. They forget that this is possible for them,) Tj T*
(not because they have sufficient funds in their own coffers to supply) Tj T*
(every credit need, but because an increasing part of their business is) Tj T*
