() Tj T*
(A. The most important reason was that it was thought that a great) Tj T*
(central institution like the Reichsbank, with its tasks and duties to) Tj T*
(the whole of the community, ought not to make a distinction of any) Tj T*
(class, or make an exception in favour of any one. It is the policy of) Tj T*
