(and pink. The white is for withdrawing cash over the counter, the pink) Tj T*
(for making transfers.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Have you different classes of deposits?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. No.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Do you pay interest on your deposits?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. The Reichsbank does not pay interest on money deposited with it. It) Tj T*
(receives money on deposit and for transfer. Most large houses keep an) Tj T*
(account with the Reichsbank. The Reichsbank does a large transfer) Tj T*
(business for them.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
