(we practically compete in some ways. Our rates on deposits are less) Tj T*
(favorable than those of these banks.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Do you take real estate mortgages?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. No.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. You are known as the sea-trade \(Seehandlung\) society. Why is that?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Frederick the Great founded the Seehandlung to promote Prussian) Tj T*
(trade, especially the oversea trade. At one time this company had a salt) Tj T*
(monopoly and a wax monopoly. The salt which came into the different) Tj T*
(ports of Prussia and the wax which came from Poland were bought up by) Tj T*
(the Seehandlung. At one time the Seehandlung also had mills, spinning) Tj T*
(and weaving plants, iron foundries, and river steamers. We still own two) Tj T*
(industrial establishments, the flour mills in Bromberg and a linen) Tj T*
(spinnery in Landeshut in Silesia.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. A large percentage of your funds is loaned on the stock exchange?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Yes.) Tj T*
