(their fellow countrymen form the great bulk of the business of the four) Tj T*
(leading institutions; the Commercial Bank of Spanish America is,) Tj T*
(however, operating under different conditions. Indeed, it may even be) Tj T*
(said--again speaking in broad terms--that the English banks have made) Tj T*
(comparatively little effort to secure the accounts of domestic) Tj T*
(enterprises. It is certainly safe to say that they have not made efforts) Tj T*
