(PERSONAL CHARACTER OF BUSINESS DEALINGS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(To an observer accustomed to European or American methods, one of the) Tj T*
(most striking features of business life in the South American cities is) Tj T*
(its strongly personal and social flavour. We are accustomed in this) Tj T*
(country to emphasise the principle that friendship is not a safe guide) Tj T*
(in business dealings. In South America the contrary is more nearly true.) Tj T*
(Family ties are apt to be a controlling factor in choosing partners and) Tj T*
(employes. If one's ultimate object is to have business dealings with a) Tj T*
(firm, he must first cultivate the personal friendship of the head of the) Tj T*
(firm. Social relations and business relations become confused, and it is) Tj T*
(hopeless to expect the purely impersonal view of a business proposition) Tj T*
(that is considered correct in this country. Like all sweeping) Tj T*
(statements, this one is subject to exceptions. There are many American,) Tj T*
(German, and English firms, especially in Buenos Aires, which prefer what) Tj T*
(we denominate "businesslike methods," but they are not numerous enough) Tj T*
(to give the tone to business life.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This is a condition which directly affects banking practice. It makes it) Tj T*
(very difficult, for example, to introduce the custom of securing full) Tj T*
(financial statements from all applicants for credit. The request for a) Tj T*
(statement is apt to be construed \(as was the case in this country not) Tj T*
(many years ago\) as a reflection on the personal honesty and credit) Tj T*
(standing of the applicant. For the same reason it is difficult, and may) Tj T*
(frequently be poor policy, for a bank officer to ask a customer a direct) Tj T*
(question as to the status of his business. He is likely not to take an) Tj T*
(impersonal attitude toward the question, but to resent it as if it were) Tj T*
(an attempt to pry into his purely personal affairs. Consequently, all) Tj T*
(business men, including bankers, are forced to rely to a great extent in) Tj T*
(estimating the credit standing of individuals and firms on their) Tj T*
(personal impressions, on such information as they are able to secure) Tj T*
