() Tj T*
([198]The United States, although the leading country of the world in the) Tj T*
(amount of its agricultural products and in the extent of its banking) Tj T*
(business, is behind nearly every other progressive country of importance) Tj T*
(in the development of agricultural credit, _i. e._, short-time) Tj T*
