(these industries is thereby rendered manifoldly efficient; not so with) Tj T*
(agriculture. Most farmers apparently make little or no use of short-time) Tj T*
(credit. There seems to be a wide acceptance in this country even among) Tj T*
(the farmers themselves of the dictum of Louis XIV, that: "Credit) Tj T*
(supports agriculture, as the cord supports the hanged." Is this a) Tj T*
(correct description of the situation? If so, what is the explanation,) Tj T*
(and what remedies if any are needed? The object of this paper is to) Tj T*
(throw light upon the answers to these questions.) Tj T*
