(bank of the district, or more importantly from the central bank of the) Tj T*
(Empire at which the local bank keeps a current account and with which it) Tj T*
(may rediscount its paper. Funds are also sometimes obtained from other) Tj T*
(banks or from private individuals. \(c\) A purely nominal share capital) Tj T*
