(The peculiarity, however, of an up-grade movement which rests on modern) Tj T*
(credit facilities is that we wear magnifying glasses or look at the) Tj T*
(future in too roseate a light. It is a natural tendency of human nature) Tj T*
(to capitalize one's hopes and expectations too liberally. If this is) Tj T*
