(cotton-spinning, on the contrary, are always in precarious dependence) Tj T*
(upon the year's harvests. In the organic industries, one may say, the) Tj T*
(condition of business is determined by the harvests; in the inorganic) Tj T*
(industries the condition of business determines the production of raw) Tj T*
(materials. The modern crisis, then, following upon a period of) Tj T*
(prosperity, is substantially the result of the different rhythm of) Tj T*
