(reduction of interest has overtaken the fall of prices. At this point) Tj T*
(business men find their profits rising to the normal level. Borrowing) Tj T*
(becomes freer, the volume of deposit currency swells, prices start) Tj T*
(upward, and the cycle begins afresh.[243]) Tj T*
