(incalculable chances of the harvests, and in which the market value of) Tj T*
(all accumulated stocks of materials and finished goods wavers with the) Tj T*
(crop reports. There are always some lines in which the recent) Tj T*
(construction of new equipment has increased the capacity for production) Tj T*
(faster than the demand for their wares has expanded under the repressing) Tj T*
(influence of the high prices which must be charged to prevent a) Tj T*
(reduction of profits. The unwillingness of investors to let fresh) Tj T*
(contracts threatens loss not only to contracting firms of all sorts, but) Tj T*
(also to all the enterprises from whom they buy materials and supplies.) Tj T*
