(overwhelming majority of enterprises meet the demand for payment with) Tj T*
(success, the tenor of business developments therefore undergoes a) Tj T*
(change. Expansion gives place to contraction, though without a violent) Tj T*
(wrench. Discount rates rise higher than usual, securities and) Tj T*
(commodities fall in price, and as old orders are completed working) Tj T*
