(Of course the contraction in the physical volume of trade and the fall) Tj T*
(of prices reduce the margin of present and prospective profits, spread) Tj T*
(discouragement among business men, and check enterprise. But they also) Tj T*
(set in motion certain processes of readjustment by which depression is) Tj T*
(gradually overcome.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The prime costs of doing business are reduced by the rapid fall in the) Tj T*
(prices of raw materials and of bank loans, by the marked increase in the) Tj T*
(efficiency of labor which comes when employment is scarce and men are) Tj T*
