(banking reserve of that country, ought at the very beginning of an) Tj T*
(unfavourable foreign exchange at once to raise the rate of interest, so) Tj T*
(as to prevent their reserve from being diminished farther, and so as to) Tj T*
(replenish it by imports of bullion....) Tj T*
() Tj T*
