(merchants, to minor bankers, to "this man and that man," whenever the) Tj T*
(security is good. In wild periods of alarm, one failure makes many, and) Tj T*
(the best way to prevent the derivative failures is to arrest the primary) Tj T*
(failure which causes them. The way in which the panic of 1825 was) Tj T*
