(much bitter experience. But the experience which led to a complete) Tj T*
(prohibition of real estate loans was gained amid the economic conditions) Tj T*
(of the first half of the last century, and the principle itself is one) Tj T*
(which is applicable only to a particular form of banking organization.) Tj T*
