(unoccupied fertile land, real estate was a security of most uncertain) Tj T*
(value. Moreover, the wildest of the speculative movements which preceded) Tj T*
(all our early crises were invariably in land. At present, land values) Tj T*
(are far more stable, and real estate is everywhere included among the) Tj T*
(most conservative of investments, proper for all with the one exception) Tj T*
(of commercial banks.) Tj T*
