(not in the same degree as in the last case, if the new law proves as) Tj T*
(successful as many conservative students expect, the need in question) Tj T*
(will be little, if at all, experienced. We shall usually escape the) Tj T*
(extreme business inflation of the antepanic period; the panic itself) Tj T*
(will be much abated, if not completely eliminated; and, in consequence,) Tj T*
(the trade reaction which naturally follows a panic will be much) Tj T*
(diminished in intensity. If this turns out to be true, the circulation) Tj T*
