(currency, has been introduced. For each dollar of this paper there is) Tj T*
(set aside from 40 cents to $1 of gold. As in the case of the) Tj T*
(national-bank note, the obligation of the United States and the assets) Tj T*
(of the issuing bank secure it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The process in which this and other Federal Reserve Banks have been) Tj T*
(engaged is the substitution, as a circulating medium, of a note which is) Tj T*
(elastic in quality for the inelastic gold certificate. Gold is the most) Tj T*
(uneconomical medium of hand-to-hand circulation since, when held in bank) Tj T*
(reserves, it will support a volume of credit equal to four or five times) Tj T*
(its own volume. What the reserve bank does in accumulating gold behind) Tj T*
(its Federal Reserve notes is to establish with the holder of each note a) Tj T*
(credit which may be availed of whenever the occasion requires. With this) Tj T*
(credit established it can convert at will its gold-covered notes into) Tj T*
(notes covered partly by gold and partly by commercial paper. In times) Tj T*
(when credit is becoming strained and bank reserves need strengthening or) Tj T*
(when gold must be exported, this conversion will take place, and after) Tj T*
(the strain is over the gold cover will be restored through the repayment) Tj T*
(of the rediscounts substituted for it. In this way elasticity of quality) Tj T*
(in our currency is obtainable. But it should not be construed as in any) Tj T*
(way a deterioration of the currency contemplated by the act. Quite the) Tj T*
(reverse is true. The act provides for the issue of Federal Reserve notes) Tj T*
