(additional banking machinery, the Board authorized the establishment of) Tj T*
(a branch of the Federal Reserve Bank of Atlanta to be located in New) Tj T*
(Orleans, and this branch was opened for business on September 10.) Tj T*
(Operations at the New Orleans branch have proceeded satisfactorily, and) Tj T*
(the institution has been of considerable use to the local banks. The) Tj T*
(branch is already more than self-supporting.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Investigation and experience have seemed to show that, at least for some) Tj T*
(years to come, the organization of branches with completely equipped) Tj T*
(offices, vaults, and the like, and with a full staff of salaried) Tj T*
(officials, will be too heavy an expense for most of the reserve banks,) Tj T*
(yet, that valuable service could be performed by local offices of the) Tj T*
(several banks in not a few places. The Board has, therefore, had under) Tj T*
(consideration the question whether establishing local agencies might not) Tj T*
(meet the requirements of the case better than the more fully organized) Tj T*
(branch office. Competent legal opinion is to the effect that the) Tj T*
(creation of such local offices is permissible under the terms of the) Tj T*
(law, and the Board believes that it may prove practicable to meet) Tj T*
(banking necessities in many sections of the country by this means.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PROPOSED AMENDMENTS TO FEDERAL RESERVE ACT[311]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
