(permit any national bank not situated in a central reserve city to make) Tj T*
(loans secured by improved and unencumbered farm land situated within its) Tj T*
(Federal Reserve district, or within a radius of 100 miles from the place) Tj T*
(in which such bank is located, irrespective of district lines. It also) Tj T*
(recommends that the powers of national banks be further extended to) Tj T*
(permit any such bank to make loans on any improved and unencumbered real) Tj T*
(estate located within 100 miles of the place in which such bank is) Tj T*
(located, irrespective of district lines; provided, however, that the) Tj T*
(aggregate of farm land loans and other real estate loans made by any) Tj T*
(national bank shall not exceed 25 per centum of its capital and surplus) Tj T*
(or one-third of its time deposits; and provided further, that no such) Tj T*
(real estate loan, as distinguished from a farm land loan, shall exceed a) Tj T*
(period of one year nor exceed 50 per centum of the actual value of the) Tj T*
(property offered as security.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is believed that the enactment of these amendments will, besides) Tj T*
(enlarging the usefulness of the national banks, result in greatly) Tj T*
(strengthening the operation of the Federal Reserve Act, and more) Tj T*
(completely realize the purposes of its framers. The text of the) Tj T*
(amendments designed to carry out these recommendations will be submitted) Tj T*
(by the Board at an early date. The Board has under consideration other) Tj T*
(suggestions for amendments to the Federal Reserve Act concerning which) Tj T*
(no conclusions have yet been reached, and regarding which the Board will) Tj T*
(take occasion to submit its views to the Congress at an appropriate time) Tj T*
(in the future.) Tj T*
