([313]During the half-century that has elapsed since the Civil War, there) Tj T*
(has probably been no period of six months within which there have) Tj T*
(occurred transformations of so far-reaching a nature in American banking) Tj T*
(and finance as during the half-year between July 1, 1914, and January 1,) Tj T*
(1915. It will be long before the full meaning and significance of these) Tj T*
(events are thoroughly understood; for what has been done cannot be) Tj T*
(finally interpreted until facts which have not yet been ascertained have) Tj T*
