(the arrows B_{c} C_{n} N_{c} C_{b}. It is illustrated by commercial) Tj T*
(firms cashing their checks at banks \(B_{c}\) for pay rolls, with the cash) Tj T*
(so obtained paying wages \(C_{n}\) to workmen who spend it \(N_{c}\) among) Tj T*
(other tradesmen who redeposit it in banks \(C_{b}\). These three types are) Tj T*
(not the only ones, but they are so much more important than any others) Tj T*
(that they merit out undivided attention before a completer study is) Tj T*
(undertaken.... [The accompanying figure] has been constructed for the) Tj T*
