(regulations governing the transfer of funds and charges therefore among) Tj T*
(federal reserve banks and their branches, and may at its discretion) Tj T*
(exercise the functions of a clearing house for such federal reserve) Tj T*
(banks, or may designate a federal reserve bank to exercise such) Tj T*
(functions, and may also require each such bank to exercise the functions) Tj T*
(of a clearing house for its member banks.") Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(II) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GENERAL PROVISIONS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In the exercise of the functions of the clearing house authorised under) Tj T*
(the provisions of section 16, quoted above, the Federal Reserve Board) Tj T*
(and the federal reserve banks will be governed by and subject to the) Tj T*
(following regulations and the Federal Reserve Board will be the) Tj T*
(custodian of the funds hereinafter termed the gold settlement fund. The) Tj T*
(board will appoint a settling agent who shall keep the necessary records) Tj T*
(and accounts.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(III) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DEPOSITS IN THE GOLD SETTLEMENT FUND) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(a\) Each federal reserve bank shall, not later than May 24, 1915,) Tj T*
(forward to the Treasury or the nearest Sub-Treasury, for credit to the) Tj T*
(account of the gold settlement fund $1,000,000 in gold, gold) Tj T*
(certificates or gold order certificates, and, in addition, an amount at) Tj T*
(least equal to its net indebtedness due to all federal reserve banks.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(b\) The Treasurer of the United States or Assistant Treasurer will, in) Tj T*
(accordance with arrangements made with the Treasury Department, advise) Tj T*
(the Federal Reserve Board, by mail or telegraph, of the receipt of all) Tj T*
(funds deposited on account of the gold settlement fund, and the) Tj T*
(Treasurer will issue and deliver to the Federal Reserve Board gold order) Tj T*
(certificates made "payable to the order of the Federal Reserve Board") Tj T*
(covering the sum so deposited.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(c\) Each federal reserve bank shall maintain a balance in the gold) Tj T*
(settlement fund of not less than $1,000,000.) Tj T*
